-- EU AI Act serious-incident reporting: tests from the source.
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice. See NOTES.md.
--
-- Every expected value below was worked out by hand from the quoted text of
-- Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 and Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, never copied from
-- the encoding's output. The arithmetic for each date is in the comment.
-- February 2028 has 29 days. No assertion here is meant to fail.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-domain`
IMPORT `aia-dates`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `aia-art73`
IMPORT `aia-gpai`
IMPORT `aia-penalties`
IMPORT `aia-seat`

§ `Tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

-- A high-risk AI system whose provider I am, placed on the Union market.
GIVEN route IS A `high-risk route`, placed IS A DATE, changed IS A MAYBE DATE, public IS A BOOLEAN, owngpai IS A BOOLEAN, pointtwo IS A BOOLEAN, vlop IS A BOOLEAN, device IS A BOOLEAN, equivalent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `AI system facts`
`a system` route placed changed public owngpai pointtwo vlop device equivalent MEANS
    `AI system facts` WITH
        `I develop the system or have it developed`                                   IS TRUE
        `I place the system on the market or put it into service`                     IS TRUE
        `the system carries my own name or trademark`                                 IS TRUE
        `the route by which the system is high-risk`                                  IS route
        `the system has been placed on the Union market`                              IS TRUE
        `the date the system was first placed on the market or put into service`      IS placed
        `the date of the latest significant change to its design, if any`            IS changed
        `the system is intended to be used by public authorities`                     IS public
        `the system is based on a general-purpose AI model from me or my undertaking` IS owngpai
        `the system is listed in point 2 of Annex III`                                IS pointtwo
        `the system is listed in point 8 of Annex III for the administration of justice` IS FALSE
        `the system is provided by an authority or financial institution within Article 74(6)` IS FALSE
        `the system is or is part of a designated very large online platform or search engine` IS vlop
        `the system is or is a safety component of a device under Regulation 2017/745 or 2017/746` IS device
        `I am subject to Union instruments with equivalent incident-reporting obligations` IS equivalent

GIVEN death IS A BOOLEAN, health IS A BOOLEAN, infra IS A BOOLEAN, rights IS A BOOLEAN, property IS A BOOLEAN, others IS A NUMBER, aware IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `incident facts`
`an incident` death health infra rights property others aware MEANS
    `incident facts` WITH
        `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system`                               IS TRUE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person`                           IS death
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person`          IS health
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS infra
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS rights
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment`     IS property
        `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS TRUE
        `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm`   IS others
        `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed`   IS FALSE
        `it is committed by the same operator`                                               IS FALSE
        `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently`                  IS 0
        `the date I became aware of it`                                                      IS aware

GIVEN compute IS A NUMBER, evaluated IS A BOOLEAN, designated IS A BOOLEAN, accepted IS A BOOLEAN, placed IS A DATE
GIVETH A `model facts`
`a model` compute evaluated designated accepted placed MEANS
    `model facts` WITH
        `I develop the model or have it developed`                              IS TRUE
        `I place the model on the market under my own name or trademark`        IS TRUE
        `it is a general-purpose AI model`                                      IS TRUE
        `the cumulative training computation in floating point operations`     IS compute
        `an evaluation with appropriate technical tools found high impact capabilities` IS evaluated
        `the Commission has designated it a model with systemic risk`           IS designated
        `the Commission has accepted my Article 52(2) arguments`               IS accepted
        `the date the model was first placed on the market`                    IS placed

-- Shorthands.
amended MEANS `as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744`
enacted MEANS `as enacted`
annexiii MEANS `Article 6(2), listed in Annex III`
sectiona MEANS `Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I`
sectionb MEANS `Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I`

-- S1: Annex III, placed 10 Jan 2028 (after the amended cut-off of 2 Dec 2027),
-- nothing else. Asked on 1 March 2028 under the amended text.
s1 MEANS `a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
d1 MEANS YearMonthDay 2028 3 1
-- S1 without my name or trademark on it: I am not its provider (Art 3(3)).
s1notmine MEANS
    `AI system facts` WITH
        `I develop the system or have it developed`                                   IS TRUE
        `I place the system on the market or put it into service`                     IS TRUE
        `the system carries my own name or trademark`                                 IS FALSE
        `the route by which the system is high-risk`                                  IS annexiii
        `the system has been placed on the Union market`                              IS TRUE
        `the date the system was first placed on the market or put into service`      IS YearMonthDay 2028 1 10
        `the date of the latest significant change to its design, if any`            IS NOTHING
        `the system is intended to be used by public authorities`                     IS FALSE
        `the system is based on a general-purpose AI model from me or my undertaking` IS FALSE
        `the system is listed in point 2 of Annex III`                                IS FALSE
        `the system is listed in point 8 of Annex III for the administration of justice` IS FALSE
        `the system is provided by an authority or financial institution within Article 74(6)` IS FALSE
        `the system is or is part of a designated very large online platform or search engine` IS FALSE
        `the system is or is a safety component of a device under Regulation 2017/745 or 2017/746` IS FALSE
        `I am subject to Union instruments with equivalent incident-reporting obligations` IS FALSE
-- Serious harm to health only; aware 10 Feb 2028.
healthinc MEANS `an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)
deathinc MEANS `an incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)
infrainc MEANS `an incident` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)
rightsinc MEANS `an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)
nothinginc MEANS `an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)
-- A death, but not from an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system.
notlinked MEANS
    `incident facts` WITH
        `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system`                               IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person`                           IS TRUE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person`          IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment`     IS FALSE
        `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS FALSE
        `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm`   IS 0
        `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed`   IS FALSE
        `it is committed by the same operator`                                               IS FALSE
        `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently`                  IS 0
        `the date I became aware of it`                                                      IS YearMonthDay 2028 2 10
-- 3(61)(b): common features, same operator, concurrently in N Member States.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `incident facts`
`an incident concurrent in this many Member States` n MEANS
    `incident facts` WITH
        `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system`                               IS TRUE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person`                           IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person`          IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS FALSE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS TRUE
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment`     IS FALSE
        `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS TRUE
        `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm`   IS 0
        `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed`   IS TRUE
        `it is committed by the same operator`                                               IS TRUE
        `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently`                  IS n
        `the date I became aware of it`                                                      IS YearMonthDay 2028 2 10

-- M1: a model trained with 2 x 10^25 operations, placed 1 Sept 2025.
twoe25 MEANS 20_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000
m1 MEANS `a model` twoe25 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)

§§ `Which text, and when (Articles 111 and 113; Omnibus Art 4)`

-- Published 24.7.2026, in force on the third day following: 27 July 2026.
#ASSERT `the version in force on` (YearMonthDay 2026 7 26) EQUALS enacted
#ASSERT `the version in force on` (YearMonthDay 2026 7 27) EQUALS amended
-- Art 113: general date 2 Aug 2026; as enacted, Art 6(1) and corresponding obligations 2 Aug 2027.
#ASSERT `the date Article 73 applies from` enacted annexiii EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2)
#ASSERT `the date Article 73 applies from` enacted sectiona EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 8 2)
#ASSERT `the date Article 73 applies from` amended sectiona EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2)
#ASSERT `the date Article 73 applies from` amended sectionb EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the date Article 73 applies from` amended `not a high-risk AI system` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Amended Art 113(c): 2 Dec 2027 (Annex III), 2 Aug 2028 (Annex I).
#ASSERT `the date Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from` amended annexiii EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 12 2)
#ASSERT `the date Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from` amended sectiona EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2)
#ASSERT `the date Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from` enacted annexiii EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2)
-- Art 111(2): cut-off 2 Aug 2026 as enacted; the Chapter III date as amended.
#ASSERT `the Article 111(2) cut-off date` enacted annexiii EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2)
#ASSERT `the Article 111(2) cut-off date` amended annexiii EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 12 2)
#ASSERT `the Article 111(2) cut-off date` amended sectiona EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2)

§§ `Article 3(49) and 3(61)`

#ASSERT `the incident is a serious incident` deathinc
#ASSERT `the incident is a serious incident` (`an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10))
#ASSERT NOT (`the incident is a serious incident` nothinginc)
#ASSERT NOT (`the incident is a serious incident` notlinked)
-- 3(61)(a): "at least two Member States other than ..." -- 2 yes, 1 no.
#ASSERT `the incident is a widespread infringement` (`an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10))
#ASSERT NOT (`the incident is a widespread infringement` (`an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)))
-- 3(61)(b): "in at least three Member States" -- 3 yes, 2 no.
#ASSERT `the incident is a widespread infringement` (`an incident concurrent in this many Member States` 3)
#ASSERT NOT (`the incident is a widespread infringement` (`an incident concurrent in this many Member States` 2))

§§ `Article 73(2), (3), (4): the clocks, both sides of each edge`

-- General route, 73(2): aware 10 Feb 2028; 10 + 15 = 25 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended s1 healthinc
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 healthinc EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 25)
#ASSERT `a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 25) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 healthinc
#ASSERT NOT (`a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 26) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 healthinc)
-- Leap year: aware 20 Feb 2028; 20 + 15 runs 9 days to 29 Feb, then 6 more: 6 Mar 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 20)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 3 6)
-- Death, 73(4): 10 + 10 = 20 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 deathinc EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 20)
#ASSERT `a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 20) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 deathinc
#ASSERT NOT (`a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 21) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 deathinc)
-- Critical infrastructure, 3(49)(b) and 73(3): 10 + 2 = 12 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 infrainc EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 12)
#ASSERT `a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 12) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 infrainc
#ASSERT NOT (`a report made on` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 13) `is within the Article 73 outer limit for` d1 amended s1 infrainc)
-- Widespread infringement, 73(3): harm to property in 2 other Member States: 12 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 (`an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 2 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 12)
-- Property harm in only 1 other Member State: not widespread, so 73(2): 25 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 (`an incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 25)
-- A death in a widespread infringement: both 73(3) and 73(4); the earlier, 2 days (fork F2).
#ASSERT `the Article 73 outer limit in days` (`an incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 2 (YearMonthDay 2028 2 10)) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the Article 73 outer limit in days` healthinc EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `the Article 73 outer limit in days` deathinc EQUALS 10

§§ `Article 73: the duty does not apply to me`

-- Not a serious incident.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended s1 nothinginc)
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 nothinginc EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
-- Not a high-risk AI system.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` `not a high-risk AI system` (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
-- A Section B product: Article 2(2), both versions.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2029 1 1) amended (`a system` sectionb (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc)
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2029 1 1) enacted (`a system` sectionb (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc)
-- Not the provider: the system does not carry my name or trademark.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (s1notmine) healthinc)

§§ `Article 73: dates of application and Article 111(2), both sides`

-- Applicability is judged on the day of awareness (aia-art73.l4), so each edge
-- below is put on the awareness date, asked on that same day. (Until
-- 2026-10-24 three of these held awareness at 10 Feb 2028 and moved only the
-- date asked; they failed when the rule moved to the awareness date, and
-- their facts were rewritten. No expected value changed. See NOTES.md.)
-- As enacted, Annex III, placed 2 Aug 2026 (not before the cut-off): aware 1 Aug 2026 no, 2 Aug 2026 yes.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) enacted (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) enacted (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2))
-- As enacted, Section A product placed 1 Sept 2026: aware 1 Aug 2027 no, 2 Aug 2027 yes.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2027 8 1) enacted (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2027 8 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2027 8 2) enacted (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2027 8 2))
-- As amended, Section A: placed on the cut-off 2 Aug 2028, aware that day, yes; placed 1 Aug 2028 and unchanged no.
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2))
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)))
-- As amended, Annex III placed 1 June 2027 (before 2 Dec 2027): unchanged no;
-- changed on 2 Dec 2027 yes; changed on 1 Dec 2027 (before the cut-off) no.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc)
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 12 2)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 12 1)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc)
-- Intended for public authorities, placed 1 June 2027, unchanged: aware 1 Aug 2030 no, 2 Aug 2030 yes.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2030 8 1) amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2030 8 1)))
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2030 8 2) amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2030 8 2))

§§ `Article 73 judged on the day of awareness (open question 7)`

-- As amended, Annex III placed 1 June 2027 (before the 2 Dec 2027 cut-off),
-- design changed significantly on 15 Jan 2028, asked on 1 March 2028.
-- Aware 10 Jan 2028, before the change: the Regulation did not reach the
-- system that day, so no duty. (Judged on the date asked, this said "must
-- report" with a deadline of 25 Jan 2028, already past when asked.)
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10)))
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10)) EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
-- Aware on the day of the change, 15 Jan 2028: duty; 15 + 15 = 30 Jan 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 1 30)
-- Aware 20 Jan 2028: 20 + 15 runs 11 days to 31 Jan, then 4 more: 4 Feb 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2027 6 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2028 1 15)) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 1 20)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 4)

§§ `Article 75(1a) applies Article 73(2) to (9), not (10) (open question 8)`

-- A medical device (Section A) that is part of a designated very large online
-- platform: under the AI Office by Article 75(1)(b). As amended, Article
-- 73(10)'s limit to point (c) incidents does not apply on that route, so harm
-- to health alone must be reported, to the AI Office. Aware and asked 1 Sept 2028.
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1))
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)) EQUALS `the AI Office`
-- 1 Sept 2028 + 15 = 16 Sept 2028.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 16)
-- The same facts as enacted: no Article 75(1a), so 73(10) limits reports to point (c): none.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) enacted (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) (`an incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1)))

§§ `To whom: Article 73(1), (10) and Article 75(1), (1a)`

#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` d1 amended s1 healthinc EQUALS `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`
-- Built on my own general-purpose AI model, Annex III, not point 2: the AI Office, as amended.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `the AI Office`
-- The same facts read under the text as enacted: no Article 75(1a), so the market surveillance authorities.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` d1 enacted (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`
-- Own model but point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure): exception (ii).
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`
-- Own model but a Section A product: exception (i).
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `the market surveillance authorities of the Member States where the incident occurred`
-- Part of a designated very large online platform: Article 75(1)(b).
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `the AI Office`
-- A medical device (Section A), point (c) incident: 73(10), the national competent authority.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) rightsinc EQUALS `the national competent authority chosen by the Member State where the incident occurred`
-- The same device, harm to health only: 73(10) limits reports to point (c), so none.
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 73` (YearMonthDay 2028 9 1) amended (`a system` sectiona (YearMonthDay 2028 8 2) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) healthinc EQUALS `no report is required of me`
-- 73(9): Annex III, equivalent Union reporting obligations: health only no; point (c) yes.
#ASSERT NOT (`must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) healthinc)
#ASSERT `must I report the incident under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) rightsinc

§§ `Article 73(5), (6), (8) and Article 20(2)`

#ASSERT `may I first submit an incomplete initial report` d1 amended s1 healthinc TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`may I first submit an incomplete initial report` d1 amended s1 healthinc FALSE)
#ASSERT `by when must the complete report follow` d1 amended s1 healthinc EQUALS `no period stated` "followed by a complete report"
#ASSERT `by when must I investigate the incident` d1 amended s1 healthinc EQUALS `no period stated` "without delay"
#ASSERT NOT (`may I alter the AI system in my investigation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `may I alter the AI system in my investigation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `may I alter the AI system in my investigation` FALSE FALSE
-- 73(8): received 25 Feb 2028; 25 + 7 runs 4 days to 29 Feb, then 3 more: 3 Mar 2028.
#ASSERT `the last day for the authority to take measures on my report` (YearMonthDay 2028 2 25) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2028 3 3
-- 20(2): "immediately", no period; and not before Chapter III applies (2 Dec 2027 as amended).
#ASSERT `by when must I inform under Article 20(2)` d1 amended s1 TRUE EQUALS `no period stated` "immediately"
#ASSERT `by when must I inform under Article 20(2)` (YearMonthDay 2027 12 1) amended s1 TRUE EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
#ASSERT `by when must I inform under Article 20(2)` d1 amended s1 FALSE EQUALS `no duty applies to me`

§§ `Articles 51, 52(1) and 55(1)(c)`

-- 51(2): "greater than 10^25" -- exactly 10^25 is not, 10^25 + 1 is.
#ASSERT NOT (`my model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` (`a model` 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_000 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)))
#ASSERT `my model is presumed to have high impact capabilities` (`a model` 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1))
#ASSERT `my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` m1
#ASSERT NOT (`my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` (`a model` twoe25 FALSE FALSE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)))
#ASSERT `my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` (`a model` twoe25 FALSE TRUE TRUE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1))
#ASSERT `my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` (`a model` 1_000 TRUE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` (`a model` 1_000 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)))
-- 52(1): condition met 1 Sept 2025; two weeks = 14 days: 15 Sept 2025.
#ASSERT `by when must I notify the Commission under Article 52(1)` m1 (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1) EQUALS `no later than` (YearMonthDay 2025 9 15)
#ASSERT `by when must I notify the Commission under Article 52(1)` (`a model` 1_000 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1)) (YearMonthDay 2025 9 1) EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
-- 55(1)(c): "without undue delay" -- NO period stated, never Article 73's 15/10/2 days.
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2025 10 1) m1 healthinc EQUALS `no period stated` "without undue delay"
#ASSERT `to whom must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2025 10 1) m1 healthinc EQUALS `the AI Office and, as appropriate, national competent authorities`
-- Chapter V applies from 2 Aug 2025: placed that day, 1 Aug no, 2 Aug yes.
