#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2027 8 1) (`a model` twoe25 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1)) healthinc EQUALS `no duty applies to me`
#ASSERT `by when must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2027 8 2) (`a model` twoe25 FALSE FALSE FALSE (YearMonthDay 2025 7 1)) healthinc EQUALS `no period stated` "without undue delay"
