§§ `Penalties: Articles 99, 101 and 75c(4)`

-- 99(4): EUR 15M or 3% of turnover, whichever is higher.
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `another undertaking` 100_000_000 EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `another undertaking` 500_000_000 EQUALS 15_000_000
-- 99(6): SMEs, whichever is lower.
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `an SME, including a start-up` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `an SME, including a start-up` 100_000_000 EQUALS 3_000_000
-- 99(6a), inserted by the Omnibus: SMCs, whichever is lower; as enacted, the general rule.
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` enacted `an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the Article 99(4) maximum in euros` amended `not an undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS 15_000_000
-- Not reporting under Article 73, nationally supervised: no ceiling in this Regulation (finding F8).
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` d1 amended s1 healthinc `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no maximum in this Regulation: the Member State rules under Article 99(1)`
-- Supervised by the AI Office (own model): Article 75c(4)(a) brings in Article 99(4).
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` d1 amended (`a system` annexiii (YearMonthDay 2028 1 10) NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) healthinc `an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 73` d1 amended s1 nothinginc `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no duty applies, so no fine for breaching it`
-- Not informing under Article 20(2): Article 16(j), so Article 99(4)(a).
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not informing under Article 20(2)` d1 amended s1 TRUE `another undertaking` 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 30_000_000
-- Not reporting under Article 55(1)(c): Article 101, which applies from 2 Aug 2026.
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 1) m1 healthinc 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `no power to fine under this provision applies on that date`
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) m1 healthinc 1_000_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 30_000_000
#ASSERT `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` (YearMonthDay 2026 8 2) m1 healthinc 100_000_000 EQUALS `up to` 15_000_000

